  data: {
    LLM: "1. Players take turns playing one card from their hand.\n2. Capturing (Scooping): A card can capture a table card of the same rank (Matching) or multiple table cards that sum to the played card's value (Summing).\n3. Face Cards: K, Q, J have no numerical value and can ONLY capture their own rank.",
    Player: "1. Players take turns playing one card from their hand.\n2. Capturing (Scooping): A card can capture a table card of the same rank (Matching) or multiple table cards that sum to the played card's value (Summing).\n3. Face Cards: K, Q, J have no numerical value and can ONLY capture their own rank.",
    objective: 'Capture the most cards from the table. Every card captured is worth 1 point at the end of the game.',
